  "prefLabel": "Ins 4703.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 4703.01 Purpose. The purpose of this part is to implement the provisions of RSA 402-L and RSA 412:2 to standardize and simplify the terms and provisions of blanket, group, or individual personal inland marine travel insurance policies covering personal risks incidental to planned travel for trips lasting less than 12 months in duration, and to establish standards for the commissioner's approval of forms and rates under RSA 412:5, 412:15, 412:16, 412:19, RSA 415:1, and RSA 415-A governing forms and rates.\n\nSource. #10681, eff 11-3-14; ss by #13989, eff 5-29-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ins4700.html"
}
